<title>TURKEY: Turkey's oil imports fall 2.53 percent in 1996.</title>
<headline>Turkey's oil imports fall 2.53 percent in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's crude oil imports fell by 2.53 percent to 22.92 million tonnes in 1996 from 23.51 million tonnes in 1995, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
